4-602.13 The following nonfood contact surfaces were observed to be soiled: 
A) bottom inside the 2 door upright cooler (splash);
B) tray holding unused tea dispenser (sticky buildup);
C) under soda machine (splash/general debris);
D) left drain board and storage pan at 3 part sink (general buildup);  and
E) counters and cabinet doors by handsink (splash).
Clean the aforementioned items, and maintain them clean.
Nonfood contact surfaces shall be cleaned at a frequency necessary to eliminate buildup of grease, food splash and general debris.
